# Polynomial/rational normal forms, zero polynomials, cancellations.
expand (x-1)^20
expand (x+y)^8
factor x^3 + 3*x^2 + 3*x + 1
factor x^4 - 1
factor x^6 + x^3 + 1
factor x^100 - 1
factor x^2 - 2
cancel x/x
cancel (x^2-1)/(x-1)
expand (x-1)*(x-2)*(x-3) - (x^3 - 6*x^2 + 11*x - 6)
apart 1/(x^2-1)
together 1/x + 1/(x+1)
collect x^2*y + x*y^2 + x + y in x
